Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Form targeted follow-up requests that could distinguish plausible interpretations or correct metadata. Use respectful wording, avoid leading the observer toward the expected label, and route specialist-sensitive cases for expert review.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
